//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano
//
// The jit-path counterpart to the 01-13 overlay rungs: folds @iron.jit designs
// with iron.Reconfiguration and dispatches the result via pyxrt.runlist (no
// Makefile/gen.py/C++ host). Exercises all three reconfig-method deliveries,
// each covering both a single-design fold and a multi-design fold.
//
// RUN: %run_on_npu2% %python %S/jit_reconfiguration.py --method ctrlpkt | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=CTRLPKT
// RUN: %run_on_npu2% %python %S/jit_reconfiguration.py --method write32 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=WRITE32
// RUN: %run_on_npu2% %python %S/jit_reconfiguration.py --method loadpdi | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=LOADPDI
//
// CTRLPKT: PASS: single-design fold (method=ctrlpkt)
// CTRLPKT: PASS: multi-design fold (method=ctrlpkt)
// WRITE32: PASS: single-design fold (method=write32)
// WRITE32: PASS: multi-design fold (method=write32)
// LOADPDI: PASS: single-design fold (method=loadpdi)
// LOADPDI: PASS: multi-design fold (method=loadpdi)
